  "brief": {
    "en": "A tired night drive in city congestion — the conditions where the 'soothe vs energize' hypothesis matters. Under the default 'soothe_destress', the calmer, mid-arousal side of the ranking wins. Its partner preset runs the identical world with the hypothesis flipped and a higher-energy track wins instead.",
    "ja": "夜間・市街地の渋滞での疲れた運転 — 『癒しか覚醒か』仮説が効く条件。既定の『soothe_destress』では落ち着いた中アロusal寄りが上位に。対のプリセットは同一状況で仮説を反転し、より高エネルギーな曲が上位に。"
  },
  "contrast_with": "preset-drowsy-keepalert",
  "expectation": {
    "expected_service": {
      "top_should_be_in": [
        "humming_karaoke",
        "quiz",
        "call_response_driving",
        "music_playlist",
        "radio_style"
      ]
    },
    "expected_top": {
      "arousal_band": "mid"
    },
    "gradient": "arousal_down_implies_fit_up",
    "hypothesis": "under soothe_destress the top track differs from keep_alert on the identical world",
    "override_required": false,
    "top_fit_min": 0.08
  },
  "family": "directional_hypothesis",
  "label": {
    "en": "Tired night — soothe (default)",
    "ja": "夜間の疲労 — 癒し（既定）"
